{"ref":"BDB, פַּס²","hw":"פַּס²","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">פַּס</span>]</big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] flat of hand or foot (palm, sole);—only <span dir=\"rtl\">כְּתֹנֶת פַּסִּים</span> tunic reaching to palms and soles (v. <span dir=\"rtl\">כ׳</span>) <a data-ref=\"Genesis 37:3\" href=\"/Genesis.37.3\">Gn 37:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 37:23\" href=\"/Genesis.37.23\">23</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 37:32\" href=\"/Genesis.37.32\">32</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 13:18\" href=\"/II_Samuel.13.18\">2 S 13:18</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 13:19\" href=\"/II_Samuel.13.19\">19</a> (cf. Dr).","next":"BDB, פִּסָּה²","prev":"BDB, פסס"}